# About says how a computer finds this reader. An update check with no
# network says so in words, and its banner offers Join Wi-Fi, which opens
# the Wi-Fi page. The channel and the automatic updates are runtime controls
# on a screen of their own, and changing the channel still asks first.
wait-for Settings
expect Model, versions and Wi-Fi address
tap About
wait-for From your computer
expect kobo setup
shot settings-about
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Software update
tap Software update
wait-for Check for updates
expect Channel and automatic updates
tap Channel and automatic updates
wait-for Update Cobalt automatically
expect Update apps automatically
expect change back here at any time
expect-missing state, and secrets
shot settings-update-options
tap-id channel-beta
wait-for Confirm update channel
tap Cancel
wait-for Update Cobalt automatically
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Check for updates
scenario offline
tap Check for updates
wait-for This reader is not on Wi-Fi.
expect-missing this reader is not on a network
shot settings-update-offline
tap Join Wi-Fi
wait-for Not connected
shot settings-wifi
